{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":500822,"name":"Horst Hauser","username":"HorstHauser","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/horsthauser/{size}/60915_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-25T09:02:04.862Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eNow we have three interfaces:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCursor IDE\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ethe agents interface with “Projects”\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnd none of them can be integrated cleanly into the others to create meaningful interaction.\u003cbr\u003e\nWho comes up with such nonsense?\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-25T23:24:30.255Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":9,"reads":16,"readers_count":15,"score":48.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":172965,"topic_slug":"now-we-have-three-surfaces","display_username":"Horst Hauser","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":53314,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/now-we-have-three-surfaces/172965/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":504412,"name":"Colin","username":"Colin","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/colin/{size}/90452_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-30T22:36:48.883Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/horsthauser\"\u003e@HorstHauser\u003c/a\u003e, thanks for sharing this.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYou’re right that these don’t fit together as cleanly as they should yet. Making Cursor (the IDE), the agents window, and Grok Bot work together more smoothly is something we’re actively working towards.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003caside class=\"onebox twitterstatus\" data-onebox-src=\"https://x.com/bot/status/2105373767568621895?s=20\"\u003e\n  \u003cheader class=\"source\"\u003e\n\n      \u003ca href=\"https://x.com/bot/status/2105373767568621895?s=20\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003ex.com\u003c/a\u003e\n  \u003c/header\u003e\n\n  \u003carticle class=\"onebox-body\"\u003e\n    \u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/5/f/5fc7f5ab399c0e2ee9fe1d7ba7539eb76e3b0d7f.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" alt=\"\" data-dominant-color=\"909090\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://x.com/bot/status/2105373767568621895?s=20\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"twitter-screen-name\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://x.com/bot/status/2105373767568621895?s=20\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e@bot\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"tweet\"\u003e\n  \u003cspan class=\"tweet-description\"\u003eGrok Bot is now more powerful for building software.\n\nBots can hand off coding tasks to Cursor, manage your PRs with GitHub and Origin plugins, and share video demos of what they build. \u003ca target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://x.com/bot/status/2105373767568621895/photo/1\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003epic.x.com/7LXiFvSZN2\u003c/a\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"aspect-image-full-size\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:690/462;\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\"tweet-image\" src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/b/f/bfbfe7f65043bc7a325b7d683057501eef1f54b7_2_690x462.jpeg\" data-dominant-color=\"C3D6EB\" width=\"690\" height=\"462\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"date\"\u003e\n  \u003ca href=\"https://x.com/bot/status/2105373767568621895?s=20\" class=\"timestamp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e7:06 PM - 30 Sep 2026\u003c/a\u003e\n\n    \u003cspan class=\"like\"\u003e\n      \u003csvg viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" width=\"14px\" height=\"16px\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M462.3 62.6C407.5 15.9 326 24.3 275.7 76.2L256 96.5l-19.7-20.3C186.1 24.3 104.5 15.9 49.7 62.6c-62.8 53.6-66.1 149.8-9.9 207.9l193.5 199.8c12.5 12.9 32.8 12.9 45.3 0l193.5-199.8c56.3-58.1 53-154.3-9.8-207.9z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\n      2.6K\n    \u003c/span\u003e\n\n    \u003cspan class=\"retweet\"\u003e\n      \u003csvg viewBox=\"0 0 640 512\" width=\"14px\" height=\"16px\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M629.657 343.598L528.971 444.284c-9.373 9.372-24.568 9.372-33.941 0L394.343 343.598c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l10.823-10.823c9.562-9.562 25.133-9.34 34.419.492L480 342.118V160H292.451a24.005 24.005 0 0 1-16.971-7.029l-16-16C244.361 121.851 255.069 96 276.451 96H520c13.255 0 24 10.745 24 24v222.118l40.416-42.792c9.285-9.831 24.856-10.054 34.419-.492l10.823 10.823c9.372 9.372 9.372 24.569-.001 33.941zm-265.138 15.431A23.999 23.999 0 0 0 347.548 352H160V169.881l40.416 42.792c9.286 9.831 24.856 10.054 34.419.491l10.822-10.822c9.373-9.373 9.373-24.569 0-33.941L144.971 67.716c-9.373-9.373-24.569-9.373-33.941 0L10.343 168.402c-9.373 9.373-9.373 24.569 0 33.941l10.822 10.822c9.562 9.562 25.133 9.34 34.419-.491L96 169.881V392c0 13.255 10.745 24 24 24h243.549c21.382 0 32.09-25.851 16.971-40.971l-16.001-16z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\n      180\n    \u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n  \u003c/article\u003e\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"onebox-metadata\"\u003e\n    \n    \n  \u003c/div\u003e\n\n  \u003cdiv style=\"clear: both\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/aside\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eProjects and Grok Bot are also both very new, so this is exactly the stage where feedback like yours shapes where they go.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo make sure it gets to the right people, could you share a bit more about what you were trying to do?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWhat workflow were you going for? For example, handing work from Grok Bot to a Project, picking up a Project’s work in the IDE, or something else.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWhere exactly did it break down? What did you expect to happen, and what happened instead?\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIf you could connect just one pair of these tomorrow, which would it be and how would you want it to work?\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWould love to hear more.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":8,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-30T22:36:48.883Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":7,"readers_count":6,"score":1.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":172965,"topic_slug":"now-we-have-three-surfaces","display_username":"Colin","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://x.com/bot/status/2105373767568621895?s=20","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Grok Bot on X: \"Grok Bot is now more powerful for building software. Bots can hand off coding tasks to Cursor, manage your PRs with GitHub and Origin plugins, and share video demos of what they build.\" / X","clicks":1}],"read":true,"user_title":"Community Support Engineer","title_is_group":false,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":87436,"hidden":false,"trust_level":3,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":fal